 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>【Trim-to-Fit Customization for Any Surface】 DIY friendly and easy to cut! This mat can be trimmed to any size or shape—perfect for round corners, stair edges, or oddly shaped furniture. Ideal for repairing worn scratching posts, cat trees, or cat houses, giving your cat’s favorite spots a like-new refresh.</li>\n  <li>【Easy Install with Eco-Friendly Adhesive】 Peel, stick, and secure in seconds! The self-adhesive backing allows for hassle-free installation without leaving sticky residue. Bonus adhesive strips and screw nails are also included for heavy-duty needs. Remove cleanly anytime without damaging your furniture.</li>\n  <li>【Scratch-Resistant &amp; Built to Last】 Made from 0.25-inch thick, durable material with a realistic carpet texture, this scratcher withstands daily clawing and sharpening. It satisfies your cat’s natural scratching instinct while effectively protecting your furniture—stress relief for your cat, peace of mind for you.<br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/4b57b209-28dd-45aa-96ab-d5d2bb2f0c8d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/4a4e415b-cd42-4873-a05e-9a131b3a427c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
